r</surname><given-names>DK</given-names></name><name><surname>Bhat</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Ziegler</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Impact of symptom prevalence and symptom burden on quality of life in patients with heart failure</article-title><source>European-Journal-of-Cardiovascular-Nursing (EUR-J-CARDIOVASC-NURS)</source><year>2005</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>198</fpage><lpage>206</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.ejcnurse.2005.03.010</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nordgren</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>S&#x000f6;rensen</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Symptoms experienced in the last six months of life in patients with end-stage heart failure</article-title><source>Europan Journal of Cardiovascular Nursing</source><year>2003</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>213</fpage><lpage>217</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S1474-5151(03)00059-8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Patel</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Shafazand</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Schaufelberger</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ekman</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Reasons for seeking acute care in chronic heart failure </article-title><source>European Journal of Heart Failure (Eur J Heart Fail)</source><year>2007</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>702</fpage><lpage>708</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.ejheart.2006.11.002</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gary</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-ti